libreac (1.7.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * release.yml: the publish commits sign with the organisation's commit key
    (#20)
  * release.yml: name the secrets the shared workflows read; inherit carries
    nothing across organisations (#20)
  * release.yml: grant the permissions the shared build workflows need
  * libreac 1.7.2
  * Hold the fuzz coverage to a floor and check it in CI
  * Create the build directory before fuzz-sabotage logs into it
  * Give the knock harness's real step range
  * Pin the scene replay clamp in make test
  * Wrap two lines past 100 columns
  * Arm no scene replay for a base past the head-amp table
  * Document the fuzz harnesses
  * Run the fuzz harnesses in CI
  * Plant a one-line mutant per harness and require the fuzzer to find it
  * Add the coverage witness for the fuzz corpus
  * Fuzz the pcap reader
  * Fuzz the grant and the head-amp table behind it
  * Fuzz the knock against its own safety argument
  * Fuzz the multi-box registry
  * Fuzz the scene push framing
  * Fuzz discovery and the hunt
  * Fuzz the identity page decode and the box naming
  * Fuzz the control-plane parsers
  * Fuzz the audio frame decoders
  * Generate the fuzz seed corpus from the test fixtures
  * Build libFuzzer harnesses against a sanitizer copy of libreac.a
  * Comments state the code's own facts: drop ticket numbers and private-repo
    citations
  * Remove the committed push-failure log and ignore it
  * Remove CHANGELOG.md and every check that read it

